<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mobil cut to attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mobil cut to attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has cut its rating for Mobil Corp to attractive from buy because of the stock's price, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the oil company closed on Monday at 135-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
